{'symbol': 'CERN', 'date': '2022-04-26 09:20:00', 'title': 'THE INTERNATIONAL GAUCHER ALLIANCE AND CERNER ENVIZA ENROLL FIRST PATIENT IN GARDIAN REGISTRY', 'text': 'KANSAS CITY, MO. , APRIL 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE INTERNATIONAL GAUCHER ALLIANCE\xa0(IGA) AND CERNER CORPORATION\xa0(NASDAQ: CERN) ANNOUNCE THAT THE GARDIAN REGISTRY (GAUCHER REGISTRY FOR DEVELOPMENT INNOVATION AND ANALYSIS OF NEURONOPATHIC DISEASE) IS NOW OPEN FOR REGISTRATIONS, AND THE FIRST PATIENT HAS ALREADY ENROLLED APRIL 25,\xa02022.'}